r systems, detect threats, and respond to security incidents. Their salary in India usually ranges from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/cyber-security-analyst-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b96.4 LPA to \u20b97 LPA<\/a>. With experience and advanced skills in threat analysis and security tools, professionals can move into higher-paying roles with better responsibilities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Security Engineer Salary<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Security engineers design and implement secure systems to protect organizations from cyber threats. Their salary typically ranges between <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/security-engineer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b910.2 LPA to \u20b911.3 LPA<\/a>. Skilled engineers with expertise in cloud security, DevSecOps, and automation are in high demand and can command premium salaries.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bug Bounty Hunter Earnings<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Bug bounty hunters earn by finding and reporting vulnerabilities in real-world applications. Their income can range from \u20b950,000 to several lakhs per month. Top hunters on global platforms can earn significantly higher rewards.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Red Team vs Blue Team Salary<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Red team professionals simulate attacks, while blue team experts focus on defense and monitoring. Salaries for both roles range from \u20b910 LPA to \u20b925 LPA, depending on expertise. Red team specialists often earn slightly higher due to advanced offensive security skills and specialized experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class